Timo Salmi TeLiX, release 1.1 includes the following files:
*    *     * * *          * *

TSTLX11         Utilities for Telix, T.Salmi
Filename        Comment
--------        --------------------------------
9600E.SLT       Initialize MultiTech MultiModem
FILE_ID.DIZ     Brief characterization of TSTLX
FINDPORT.SLT    Test which port has a modem
FTPGET.SLT      Autodownloading from ftp sites
IN2.TRN         Scandinavian incoming tr. table
MBBS.SLT        Connect to an MBBS system
OUT.TRN         Scandinavian outgoing tr. table
TIMER.SLT       An elapsed time reminder
TRANSOFF.SLT    Turn off char translation tables
TRANSON2.SLT    Turn on both translation tables
TSPROG.INF      List of PD programs from T.Salmi
TSTLX.INF       A readme
TSTLX.NWS       News announcements about tstlx
TSTLX10.BUG     How the update 1.1 came about
UNIXHOST.SLT    Connect to Unix host via server
VAASA.INF       Info: Finland, Vaasa, U of Vaasa
